---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Contact · Xiaochuan Li"
  description="Get in touch with Xiaochuan Li: email and GitHub. Applying for PhD positions beginning in fall 2027, combining formal semantics with behavioural or computational work on how linguistic expressions guide reasoning."
>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-8">Contact</h1>

  <div class="space-y-5 max-w-prose">
    <p class="leading-relaxed">
      Email is the best way to reach me. Messages about formal or computational semantics, language
      and reasoning, or linguistically informed model analysis are especially welcome, and usually get
      a reply within a few days.
    </p>

    <div class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)] pt-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-[var(--color-text-dim)] w-20 shrink-0">Email</span>
        <a href="mailto:xiaochuan.li@utn.de" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">xiaochuan.li@utn.de</a>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-[var(--color-text-dim)] w-20 shrink-0">GitHub</span>
        <a href="https://github.com/xchuan-li" class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline">github.com/xchuan-li</a>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <span class="text-[var(--color-text-dim)] w-20 shrink-0">Location</span>
        <span>Nürnberg, Germany</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-md p-4 mt-6">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-text-dim)] font-medium mb-1.5">
        Applying for PhDs
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
        I'm applying for PhD positions beginning in fall 2027 — ideally with groups where formal
        semantics can meet behavioural or computational work on how linguistic expressions guide
        reasoning. If that overlaps with your group's work, please get in touch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
